---
const steps = [
  ['You message us', 'with a project from the register, or your own idea.', 'Day 1'],
  ['We get on a call', '15 to 20 minutes to fix the scope, tech stack, deadline and price.', 'Day 1 or 2'],
  ['Synopsis for your guide', 'We write the synopsis and abstract so your guide can approve the topic.', 'In 2 to 3 days'],
  ['We build it in stages', 'You see a working demo before each review, so nothing is a surprise at the end.', 'Weeks 1 to 5'],
  ['Report, PPT and diagrams', "In your college's format, ready to print and bind.", 'Before the final review'],
  ['Setup, walkthrough, mock viva', "We install it on your laptop, take you through the code and ask you the panel's questions.", 'Before your viva'],
];
---

<section class="sec" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="how-title"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>How it works</h2>
      <p>Every project goes through the same six steps. We've laid them out like the index page of a record book, and each one gets signed off before the next one starts.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="index">
      <div class="ix-head" aria-hidden="true"><span>S.No</span><span>What happens</span><span>When</span><span>Sign</span></div>
      <ol>
        {
          steps.map(([what, detail, when], i) => (
            <li>
              <span class="ix-no mono" aria-hidden="true">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <p class="ix-what">
                <strong>{what}</strong> <span class="detail">{detail}</span>
              </p>
              <span class="ix-when mono">{when}</span>
              <span class="ix-sign" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="note pay">You pay in parts as the work moves along.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .index {
    --no-w: 64px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper-2);
  }
  .ix-head,
  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--no-w) minmax(0, 1fr) 200px 76px;
  }
  .ix-head span,
  li > * {
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .ix-head span + span,
  li > * + * {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .ix-head {
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--f-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .ix-head span {
    padding-block: 10px;
  }
  ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li + li {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .ix-no {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .ix-what {
    max-width: none;
  }
  .detail {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .ix-when {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .ix-sign {
    font-family: var(--f-hand);
    color: var(--red);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }
  li:nth-child(odd) .ix-sign {
    transform: rotate(-6deg);
  }
  li:nth-child(3n) .ix-sign {
    transform: rotate(5deg) translateX(3px);
  }
  .pay {
    margin-top: 22px;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    transform-origin: left;
  }
  @media (max-width: 759px) {
    .index {
      --no-w: 46px;
    }
    .ix-head {
      display: none;
    }
    li {
      grid-template-columns: var(--no-w) minmax(0, 1fr) 40px;
      grid-template-areas:
        'no what sign'
        'no when sign';
    }
    li > * {
      border: 0 !important;
    }
    li > .ix-no {
      grid-area: no;
      padding: 13px 0 0 12px;
    }
    li > .ix-what {
      grid-area: what;
      padding: 12px 4px 0 0;
    }
    li > .ix-when {
      grid-area: when;
      padding: 4px 0 14px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
    li > .ix-sign {
      grid-area: sign;
      align-self: center;
      padding: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
